<para><verbatim>embed:rst 
One range of a mod drawn with a pixel shader of the fix&apos;s own, on the passes :cpp:member:`ShaderDraw::onPlan`
names and as :cpp:member:`ShaderDraw::fallback` everywhere else: the command list a ``run =`` in place of the
